{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1374405-taking-martial-arts-at-chargen","id":1374405,"title":"Taking Martial Arts at Chargen","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-12T13:14:03-07:00","id":1374405,"title":"Taking Martial Arts at Chargen","content":"I fully recognize that this may be a bit on the pedantic side, but I like to do things by the book (to the extent possible when the book can be <i>very</i> loose with words).<br /> <br /> The book seems to lead to an obtuse result, as I read it: that you can only purchase ability dots in MA styles with bonus points. Consider the following:<ul><li>Abilities are purchased in Step 3 of chargen. (p. 121)</li> <li>A character can't have martial arts dots without the martial arts merit. (p. 122)<ul><li>The way that this is worded is obtuse: &quot;Also, characters with Martial Arts dots must possess the Martial Artist Merit.&quot; (p. 122) One could argue that a chargen character isn't technically a &quot;character&quot; (i.e. a finished character) for the purposes of that sentence. I don't think that &quot;character&quot; is defined anywhere. (Yes, I'm aware that the book isn't that carefully written.)</li> <li>The Martial Arts Merit itself &quot;allows the character to purchase the Martial Arts ability.&quot; (p. 164)</li> </ul></li> <li>Merits are chosen in Step 4. (p. 123)</li> <li>Bonus points are used in Step 7, but the book explicitly notes that &quot;You're allowed to spend bonus points at <i>any time</i> during character creation,&quot; (p. 125) creating the negative inference that any other Step can be done out of order.</li> </ul>One way (the obtuse result) to read this is that Martial Arts dots can't be purchased in Step 3 (because your character lacks the Martial Arts Merit) unless the Merit is purchased using bonus points prior to taking the Martial Arts dots.<br /> <br /> Another way (the more natural result) to read this is that Martial Arts dots can be purchased in Step 3 because the consistency check is only done at the completely of chargen. (In deference to the writers, perhaps this is a balancing point?)<br /> <br /> The obtuse result seems to be more consistent with the words that are actually in the book, but the more natural result seems\u2014well\u2014more natural.<br /> <br /> What say you, forum? Also, please let me know if I'm just missing something (like a line telling you to only check for prereqs at the end of chargen).<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/415-equitable-remedy","name":"Equitable Remedy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar415_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T13:50:18-07:00","id":1374412,"title":"","content":"You can explicitly spend bonus points at any point in chargen, see the second paragraph of page 125.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25764-vwllss-trnt-prncss","name":"vwllss trnt prncss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"244"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T14:07:27-07:00","id":1374421,"title":"","content":"I say fuck being pedantic when it stops being fun. Buy the MA dots with your Ability Dots, make sure you snag the MA Merit when you snag your Merits, I'm not gonna skin my players alive for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T14:15:07-07:00","id":1374425,"title":"","content":"See also Step 5 - you can go back and rearrange your Ability dots at any point.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T14:36:15-07:00","id":1374430,"title":"","content":"On top of the above, there is also the precedent in the character creation example on page 131 of stuff explicitly being bought 'out of order'. It covers charms but I'd argue the principle is the same:<br /> <br /> FROM END OF STEP 5<br /> Then he selects Blurred Form Style and Mental Invisibility Technique, available because Stealth is his Supernal Ability. Otso realizes that Isthus doesn\u2019t meet the Ability prerequisites for these final two Charms, and makes a note to raise his Stealth rating with bonus points.<br /> <br /> FROM START OF STEP 7 &amp; 8<br /> The first thing Otso wants to do is bump up Isthus\u2019s Stealth score, to qualify for those Charms he took. While he\u2019s at it, he also decides there are two more Charms he really wants. He spends one bonus point to increase Isthus\u2019s Stealth to 4, four bonus points on the Charm Blinding Battle Feint, and four bonus points on Stalking Wolf Attitude<br /> <br /> Hope that helps some!<br /> <br /> ALSO: your obtuse interpretation wouldn't just apply to martial arts - as skills can only be a max of three without bonus points, you'd be limited to only picking charms with a skill 3 pre-req until you got to spend bonus points.<br /> <br /> Similar story with evocations as you wouldn't 'have' the artefact until the merit buying stage...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24647,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","user":"Moss Reynholm","date":". 03-12-2020, 07:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T10:03:50-07:00","id":1374583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1374405-taking-martial-arts-at-chargen?p=1374425#post1374425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See also Step 5 - you can go back and rearrange your Ability dots at any point.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're right! Though the way that it is written is... obtuse. (It doesn't actually say that you can, it instead just encourages you to do so!)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moss Reynholm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1374405-taking-martial-arts-at-chargen?p=1374430#post1374430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On top of the above, there is also the precedent in the character creation example on page 131 of stuff explicitly being bought 'out of order'. It covers charms but I'd argue the principle is the same:<br /> <br /> FROM END OF STEP 5<br /> Then he selects Blurred Form Style and Mental Invisibility Technique, available because Stealth is his Supernal Ability. Otso realizes that Isthus doesn\u2019t meet the Ability prerequisites for these final two Charms, and makes a note to raise his Stealth rating with bonus points.<br /> <br /> FROM START OF STEP 7 &amp; 8<br /> The first thing Otso wants to do is bump up Isthus\u2019s Stealth score, to qualify for those Charms he took. While he\u2019s at it, he also decides there are two more Charms he really wants. He spends one bonus point to increase Isthus\u2019s Stealth to 4, four bonus points on the Charm Blinding Battle Feint, and four bonus points on Stalking Wolf Attitude<br /> <br /> Hope that helps some!</div> </div> </div> </div>This is exactly what I was looking for! Thanks, all!<br /> <br /> (I maintain that putting new rules in examples is obtuse at best. Further, that these are the rules makes the language in the bonus points section superfluous.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moss Reynholm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1374405-taking-martial-arts-at-chargen?p=1374430#post1374430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ALSO: your obtuse interpretation wouldn't just apply to martial arts - as skills can only be a max of three without bonus points, you'd be limited to only picking charms with a skill 3 pre-req until you got to spend bonus points.<br /> <br /> Similar story with evocations as you wouldn't 'have' the artefact until the merit buying stage...</div> </div> </div> </div>That's as may be, but the words in the book are what they are! I didn't write them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/415-equitable-remedy","name":"Equitable Remedy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar415_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-15T13:31:38-07:00","id":1374969,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Equitable Remedy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1374405-taking-martial-arts-at-chargen?p=1374583#post1374583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's as may be, but the words in the book are what they are! I didn't write them.</div> </div> </div> </div>The book also in the Rules section says that if it works better for your table, whatever. OPP doesn't have the budget to send canon enforcement ninjas to you for fiddling with things.<br /> <br /> Also, between you and me, the corebook isn't always very well-written. Frankly, don't worry about it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}